# Climbing footage. Kept out of the repository deliberately — see Fixtures/README.md.
# Three reasons, in order: the clips show identifiable people, iPhone writes GPS
# coordinates into the QuickTime metadata, and together they are ~350MB against a
# repository that is otherwise under a megabyte.
Fixtures/*.mov
Fixtures/*.MOV
gym-testing/

